Demo Configuration
******************

These settings are used in the [demo | https://fiddle.nette.org/texy/]:

```php
$texy = new Texy\Texy;
$texy->htmlOutput->imageBaseUrl = '/images/';
$texy->config->headingIds = true;
```

Texy gives code blocks a `language-…` class, which the Prism.js library uses to highlight them. So a <code>&#96;&#96;&#96;php</code> block becomes:

```html
<pre class="language-php"><code>echo '&lt;b&gt;';</code></pre>
```

After the conversion, some characters in the text are also replaced with entities to make them easier to spot:

```php
$html = $texy->toHtml($text);

$html = str_replace(
	["\u{A0}", "\u{AD}", "\u{2013}", "\u{2014}"],
	['&nbsp;', '&shy;', '&ndash;', '&mdash;'],
	$html,
);
```

